BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Nudge 1/60: Name one specific thing
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20261012T073000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20261012T074000
DTSTAMP:20261008T030000Z
UID:tch-better-partner-he-2026-10-12-1@tchworks.co.uk
DESCRIPTION:TODAY: Send him a message today naming one specific thing he d
 id this week that made your life easier. Not 'thanks for everything'. The 
 actual thing: 'Thanks for sorting the car insurance. I know that was forty
  minutes on hold.'\n\nWHY IT WORKS: Specific thanks shows you were paying 
 attention. General thanks sounds like politeness.\n\nDay 1 of 60 · Week 1
 : Notice\n\nTCH Works · Better Partner Plan. Everyday relationship ideas
 \, not therapy or counselling. If things feel unsafe or overwhelming\, tal
 k to your GP or a relationship counselling service. In an emergency call 9
 99.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://www.tchworks.co.uk/planners/u/185521ab6e704744/
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Nudge 1/60: Name one specific thing
TRIGGER:P0D
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Nudge 2/60: Turn towards the small stuff
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20261013T073000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20261013T074000
DTSTAMP:20261008T030000Z
UID:tch-better-partner-he-2026-10-12-2@tchworks.co.uk
DESCRIPTION:TODAY: Today\, every time he points something out (a headline
 \, a dog in the street\, a message from a friend) stop and respond properl
 y. Look up\, put the phone face down\, ask one question about it.\n\nWHY I
 T WORKS: Relationship researchers call these 'bids for connection'. In a w
 ell-known study of newlyweds\, couples still together six years later had 
 turned towards each other's small bids far more often than couples who spl
 it.\n\nDay 2 of 60 · Week 1: Notice\n\nTCH Works · Better Partner Plan. 
 Everyday relationship ideas\, not therapy or counselling. If things feel u
 nsafe or overwhelming\, talk to your GP or a relationship counselling serv
 ice. In an emergency call 999.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://www.tchworks.co.uk/planners/u/185521ab6e704744/
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Nudge 2/60: Turn towards the small stuff
TRIGGER:P0D
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Nudge 3/60: The first five minutes
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20261014T073000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20261014T074000
DTSTAMP:20261008T030000Z
UID:tch-better-partner-he-2026-10-12-3@tchworks.co.uk
DESCRIPTION:TODAY: When you next see him today\, give the first five minut
 es to him\, not to logistics. Greet him properly\, ask how the day went\, 
 listen. Who's picking up whom and what's for tea can wait five minutes.\n
 \nWHY IT WORKS: Reunions set the tone for the evening. A warm one costs no
 thing and is easy to make a habit.\n\nDay 3 of 60 · Week 1: Notice\n\nTCH
  Works · Better Partner Plan. Everyday relationship ideas\, not therapy o
 r counselling. If things feel unsafe or overwhelming\, talk to your GP or 
 a relationship counselling service. In an emergency call 999.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://www.tchworks.co.uk/planners/u/185521ab6e704744/
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Nudge 3/60: The first five minutes
TRIGGER:P0D
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Nudge 4/60: Do one thing from his list
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20261015T073000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20261015T074000
DTSTAMP:20261008T030000Z
UID:tch-better-partner-he-2026-10-12-4@tchworks.co.uk
DESCRIPTION:TODAY: Find one job that has been sitting on his to-do list (t
 he dentist booking\, the parcel return\, the form for school) and do it\, 
 start to finish\, without being asked. Tell him once it's done\, not befor
 e.\n\nWHY IT WORKS: Taking a whole task off someone's plate is worth more 
 than offering to 'help with' it.\n\nDay 4 of 60 · Week 1: Notice\n\nTCH W
 orks · Better Partner Plan. Everyday relationship ideas\, not therapy or 
 counselling. If things feel unsafe or overwhelming\, talk to your GP or a 
 relationship counselling service. In an emergency call 999.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://www.tchworks.co.uk/planners/u/185521ab6e704744/
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Nudge 4/60: Do one thing from his list
TRIGGER:P0D
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Nudge 5/60: Ask about the thing
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20261016T073000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20261016T074000
DTSTAMP:20261008T030000Z
UID:tch-better-partner-he-2026-10-12-5@tchworks.co.uk
DESCRIPTION:TODAY: Think back to something he mentioned earlier this week:
  a meeting\, a worry\, a friend's news. Ask how it went\, using the detail
 . 'How did the meeting with Sam go? Did they go for the new rota?'\n\nWHY 
 IT WORKS: Remembering the detail tells him that what he says sticks with y
 ou.\n\nDay 5 of 60 · Week 1: Notice\n\nTCH Works · Better Partner Plan. 
 Everyday relationship ideas\, not therapy or counselling. If things feel u
 nsafe or overwhelming\, talk to your GP or a relationship counselling serv
 ice. In an emergency call 999.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://www.tchworks.co.uk/planners/u/185521ab6e704744/
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Nudge 5/60: Ask about the thing
TRIGGER:P0D
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Nudge 6/60: Make it exactly right
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20261017T073000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20261017T074000
DTSTAMP:20261008T030000Z
UID:tch-better-partner-he-2026-10-12-6@tchworks.co.uk
DESCRIPTION:TODAY: Make him a drink or a snack exactly the way he likes it
 \, without asking how he takes it. If you're not sure\, that's today's job
 : find out and remember.\n\nWHY IT WORKS: Small acts of care done precisel
 y land better than big gestures done generally.\n\nDay 6 of 60 · Week 1: 
 Notice\n\nTCH Works · Better Partner Plan. Everyday relationship ideas\, 
 not therapy or counselling. If things feel unsafe or overwhelming\, talk t
 o your GP or a relationship counselling service. In an emergency call 999.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://www.tchworks.co.uk/planners/u/185521ab6e704744/
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Nudge 6/60: Make it exactly right
TRIGGER:P0D
END:VALARM
