BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Nudge 7/60: First weekly check-in (15 minutes)
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20261018T073000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20261018T074000
DTSTAMP:20261008T030000Z
UID:tch-better-partner-he-2026-10-12-7@tchworks.co.uk
DESCRIPTION:TODAY: Find 15 calm minutes today. Ask two questions and only 
 listen: 'What's one thing I did this week that you liked?' and 'What's one
  thing that would make next week easier for you?' Don't defend or explain.
  Say thanks\, and pick one thing to act on.\n\nWHY IT WORKS: A short\, reg
 ular check-in keeps small irritations small. It works best when it's routi
 ne\, not only when something's wrong.\n\nDay 7 of 60 · Week 1: Notice\n\n
 TCH Works · Better Partner Plan. Everyday relationship ideas\, not therap
 y or counselling. If things feel unsafe or overwhelming\, talk to your GP 
 or a relationship counselling service. In an emergency call 999.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://www.tchworks.co.uk/planners/u/185521ab6e704744/
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Nudge 7/60: First weekly check-in (15 minutes)
TRIGGER:P0D
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Nudge 8/60: Praise him to someone else
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20261019T073000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20261019T074000
DTSTAMP:20261008T030000Z
UID:tch-better-partner-he-2026-10-12-8@tchworks.co.uk
DESCRIPTION:TODAY: Today\, say something good about him to someone else: a
  friend\, your parents\, the kids. Even better if he can hear it.\n\nWHY I
 T WORKS: Hearing yourself praised to other people feels different from a p
 rivate compliment. It says 'I'm proud of you'\, not just 'thanks'.\n\nDay 
 8 of 60 · Week 2: Say it out loud\n\nTCH Works · Better Partner Plan. Ev
 eryday relationship ideas\, not therapy or counselling. If things feel uns
 afe or overwhelming\, talk to your GP or a relationship counselling servic
 e. In an emergency call 999.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://www.tchworks.co.uk/planners/u/185521ab6e704744/
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Nudge 8/60: Praise him to someone else
TRIGGER:P0D
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Nudge 9/60: Respond to good news properly
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20261020T073000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20261020T074000
DTSTAMP:20261008T030000Z
UID:tch-better-partner-he-2026-10-12-9@tchworks.co.uk
DESCRIPTION:TODAY: When he shares any good news today\, however small\, re
 spond with real interest: ask questions\, let him tell the whole story\, b
 e pleased out loud. 'Hang on\, tell me exactly what she said.'\n\nWHY IT W
 ORKS: Research on how couples respond to each other's good news found that
  enthusiastic\, engaged responses were linked to happier relationships. A 
 distracted 'nice' can quietly do the opposite.\n\nDay 9 of 60 · Week 2: S
 ay it out loud\n\nTCH Works · Better Partner Plan. Everyday relationship 
 ideas\, not therapy or counselling. If things feel unsafe or overwhelming
 \, talk to your GP or a relationship counselling service. In an emergency 
 call 999.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://www.tchworks.co.uk/planners/u/185521ab6e704744/
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Nudge 9/60: Respond to good news properly
TRIGGER:P0D
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Nudge 10/60: A note where he'll find it
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20261021T073000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20261021T074000
DTSTAMP:20261008T030000Z
UID:tch-better-partner-he-2026-10-12-10@tchworks.co.uk
DESCRIPTION:TODAY: Write one line by hand and leave it where he'll find it
  tomorrow: the kettle\, the car seat\, a coat pocket\, a lunch box. Make i
 t specific: 'You were brilliant with Dad on Sunday.'\n\nWHY IT WORKS: A no
 te keeps working after you've written it. Many people keep them for years.
 \n\nDay 10 of 60 · Week 2: Say it out loud\n\nTCH Works · Better Partner
  Plan. Everyday relationship ideas\, not therapy or counselling. If things
  feel unsafe or overwhelming\, talk to your GP or a relationship counselli
 ng service. In an emergency call 999.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://www.tchworks.co.uk/planners/u/185521ab6e704744/
