BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Nudge 11/60: Say what you admire
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20261022T073000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20261022T074000
DTSTAMP:20261008T030000Z
UID:tch-better-partner-he-2026-10-12-11@tchworks.co.uk
DESCRIPTION:TODAY: Tell him one quality you admire that has nothing to do 
 with what he does for you. 'I love how patient you are with your mum when 
 she's anxious.' 'You're the funniest person in any room.'\n\nWHY IT WORKS:
  Appreciating who someone is\, not just what they do\, builds a sense of b
 eing seen.\n\nDay 11 of 60 · Week 2: Say it out loud\n\nTCH Works · Bett
 er Partner Plan. Everyday relationship ideas\, not therapy or counselling.
  If things feel unsafe or overwhelming\, talk to your GP or a relationship
  counselling service. In an emergency call 999.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://www.tchworks.co.uk/planners/u/185521ab6e704744/
