SUMMARY:Nudge 12/60: Ask for his advice
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20261023T073000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20261023T074000
DTSTAMP:20261008T030000Z
UID:tch-better-partner-he-2026-10-12-12@tchworks.co.uk
DESCRIPTION:TODAY: Ask his opinion on something real you're deciding: work
 \, a purchase\, how to handle a friend. Listen properly. If you don't take
  the advice\, explain why.\n\nWHY IT WORKS: Asking for advice is a quiet f
 orm of respect. It says 'I trust your judgement'.\n\nDay 12 of 60 · Week 
 2: Say it out loud\n\nTCH Works · Better Partner Plan. Everyday relations
 hip ideas\, not therapy or counselling. If things feel unsafe or overwhelm
 ing\, talk to your GP or a relationship counselling service. In an emergen
 cy call 999.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
