SUMMARY:Nudge 13/60: The 'I remember' message
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20261024T073000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20261024T074000
DTSTAMP:20261008T030000Z
UID:tch-better-partner-he-2026-10-12-13@tchworks.co.uk
DESCRIPTION:TODAY: Send him a message about a specific happy memory of the
  two of you. 'I was just thinking about that tiny café in Whitby when the
  rain came in sideways.'\n\nWHY IT WORKS: Going back over good shared memo
 ries together is linked to feeling closer. It also tends to start a nice c
 onversation later.\n\nDay 13 of 60 · Week 2: Say it out loud\n\nTCH Works
  · Better Partner Plan. Everyday relationship ideas\, not therapy or coun
 selling. If things feel unsafe or overwhelming\, talk to your GP or a rela
 tionship counselling service. In an emergency call 999.
