BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Nudge 15/60: Own a whole job
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20261026T073000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20261026T074000
DTSTAMP:20261008T030000Z
UID:tch-better-partner-he-2026-10-12-15@tchworks.co.uk
DESCRIPTION:TODAY: Choose one recurring household job and take it over com
 pletely: the noticing\, planning and doing. Bins\, packed lunches\, the sc
 hool WhatsApp\, birthday presents for your side of the family. Tell him to
 day: 'That's mine now. You don't need to think about it again.'\n\nWHY IT 
 WORKS: A lot of household strain comes from the 'mental load': remembering
 \, planning and checking\, not just doing. Owning a job entirely removes i
 t from his head\, not just his hands.\n\nDay 15 of 60 · Week 3: Lighten t
 he load\n\nTCH Works · Better Partner Plan. Everyday relationship ideas\,
  not therapy or counselling. If things feel unsafe or overwhelming\, talk 
 to your GP or a relationship counselling service. In an emergency call 999
 .
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://www.tchworks.co.uk/planners/u/185521ab6e704744/
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Nudge 15/60: Own a whole job
TRIGGER:P0D
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Nudge 16/60: Notice before you're asked
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20261027T073000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20261027T074000
DTSTAMP:20261008T030000Z
UID:tch-better-partner-he-2026-10-12-16@tchworks.co.uk
DESCRIPTION:TODAY: Today\, find three things that need doing that you'd no
 rmally wait to be told about (the full bin\, the empty loo roll\, the wash
 ing in the machine). Do them. Don't mention it.\n\nWHY IT WORKS: Being the
  person who notices is part of the work. It's often the part that goes uns
 een.\n\nDay 16 of 60 · Week 3: Lighten the load\n\nTCH Works · Better Pa
 rtner Plan. Everyday relationship ideas\, not therapy or counselling. If t
 hings feel unsafe or overwhelming\, talk to your GP or a relationship coun
 selling service. In an emergency call 999.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://www.tchworks.co.uk/planners/u/185521ab6e704744/
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Nudge 16/60: Notice before you're asked
TRIGGER:P0D
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
