SUMMARY:Nudge 17/60: Clear the evening
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20261028T073000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20261028T074000
DTSTAMP:20261008T030000Z
UID:tch-better-partner-he-2026-10-12-17@tchworks.co.uk
DESCRIPTION:TODAY: Tell him this morning that tonight is covered: you're d
 oing tea\, the washing up and anything else that comes up after 7pm. Then 
 do it\, without commentary.\n\nWHY IT WORKS: Knowing in the morning that t
 he evening is free gives him something to look forward to all day.\n\nDay 
 17 of 60 · Week 3: Lighten the load\n\nTCH Works · Better Partner Plan. 
 Everyday relationship ideas\, not therapy or counselling. If things feel u
 nsafe or overwhelming\, talk to your GP or a relationship counselling serv
 ice. In an emergency call 999.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
