SUMMARY:Nudge 18/60: Plan the week's meals
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20261029T073000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20261029T074000
DTSTAMP:20261008T030000Z
UID:tch-better-partner-he-2026-10-12-18@tchworks.co.uk
DESCRIPTION:TODAY: Spend ten minutes planning this week's evening meals an
 d write the shopping list. Then do the shop\, or book the delivery.\n\nWHY
  IT WORKS: 'What are we having for tea?' is one of the most repeated decis
 ions in any home. Taking it away for a week is a real gift.\n\nDay 18 of 6
 0 · Week 3: Lighten the load\n\nTCH Works · Better Partner Plan. Everyda
 y relationship ideas\, not therapy or counselling. If things feel unsafe o
 r overwhelming\, talk to your GP or a relationship counselling service. In
  an emergency call 999.
