SUMMARY:Nudge 19/60: Book the thing
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20261030T073000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20261030T074000
DTSTAMP:20261008T030000Z
UID:tch-better-partner-he-2026-10-12-19@tchworks.co.uk
DESCRIPTION:TODAY: There's an appointment or booking that keeps getting pu
 t off: the MOT\, the boiler service\, the haircut\, the vet. Book it today
  and put it in both your calendars.\n\nWHY IT WORKS: Unfinished admin take
 s up head space even when nobody's doing it.\n\nDay 19 of 60 · Week 3: Li
 ghten the load\n\nTCH Works · Better Partner Plan. Everyday relationship 
 ideas\, not therapy or counselling. If things feel unsafe or overwhelming
 \, talk to your GP or a relationship counselling service. In an emergency 
 call 999.
