DTSTAMP:20261008T030000Z
UID:tch-better-partner-he-2026-10-12-26@tchworks.co.uk
DESCRIPTION:TODAY: Next time you hug him today\, don't be the first to let
  go.\n\nWHY IT WORKS: Unhurried physical affection is a simple\, low-effor
 t way to feel close. It's easy to make this a daily habit.\n\nDay 26 of 60
  · Week 4: Time and attention\n\nTCH Works · Better Partner Plan. Everyd
 ay relationship ideas\, not therapy or counselling. If things feel unsafe 
 or overwhelming\, talk to your GP or a relationship counselling service. I
 n an emergency call 999.
