DTSTAMP:20261008T030000Z
UID:tch-better-partner-he-2026-10-12-29@tchworks.co.uk
DESCRIPTION:TODAY: Ask him one of these today and really listen: 'What did
  you want to be when you were ten?'\, 'What's a smell that takes you strai
 ght back to childhood?'\, 'What's the best piece of advice you've ever bee
 n given?'\n\nWHY IT WORKS: However long you've been together\, there's alw
 ays more to find out. Curiosity is a sign of interest\, and people feel it
 .\n\nDay 29 of 60 · Week 5: Be curious\n\nTCH Works · Better Partner Pla
 n. Everyday relationship ideas\, not therapy or counselling. If things fee
 l unsafe or overwhelming\, talk to your GP or a relationship counselling s
 ervice. In an emergency call 999.
