DTSTAMP:20261008T030000Z
UID:tch-better-partner-he-2026-10-12-30@tchworks.co.uk
DESCRIPTION:TODAY: Ask about one of his friends by name: how they're doing
 \, what's going on in their life. Remember the answer for next time.\n\nWH
 Y IT WORKS: Caring about the people who matter to him is a way of caring a
 bout him.\n\nDay 30 of 60 · Week 5: Be curious\n\nTCH Works · Better Par
 tner Plan. Everyday relationship ideas\, not therapy or counselling. If th
 ings feel unsafe or overwhelming\, talk to your GP or a relationship couns
 elling service. In an emergency call 999.
