SUMMARY:Nudge 31/60: The 'one year off' question
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20261111T073000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20261111T074000
DTSTAMP:20261008T030000Z
UID:tch-better-partner-he-2026-10-12-31@tchworks.co.uk
DESCRIPTION:TODAY: Ask: 'If money and time didn't matter for one year\, wh
 at would you do with it?' Ask why. Don't point out why it's impractical.\n
 \nWHY IT WORKS: Knowing someone's hopes\, even unrealistic ones\, is part 
 of knowing them well.\n\nDay 31 of 60 · Week 5: Be curious\n\nTCH Works 
 · Better Partner Plan. Everyday relationship ideas\, not therapy or couns
 elling. If things feel unsafe or overwhelming\, talk to your GP or a relat
 ionship counselling service. In an emergency call 999.
