BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Nudge 32/60: Listen first\, fix later
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20261112T073000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20261112T074000
DTSTAMP:20261008T030000Z
UID:tch-better-partner-he-2026-10-12-32@tchworks.co.uk
DESCRIPTION:TODAY: Ask: 'What's the hardest thing about work (or life) rig
 ht now?' Then before you offer any advice\, ask: 'Do you want ideas\, or d
 o you want me to just listen?' Do whichever he says.\n\nWHY IT WORKS: Jump
 ing straight to solutions can make people feel unheard. Asking first tells
  you which kind of help is wanted.\n\nDay 32 of 60 · Week 5: Be curious\n
 \nTCH Works · Better Partner Plan. Everyday relationship ideas\, not ther
 apy or counselling. If things feel unsafe or overwhelming\, talk to your G
 P or a relationship counselling service. In an emergency call 999.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://www.tchworks.co.uk/planners/u/185521ab6e704744/
