DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20261113T074000
DTSTAMP:20261008T030000Z
UID:tch-better-partner-he-2026-10-12-33@tchworks.co.uk
DESCRIPTION:TODAY: Ask him about a happy memory from before you met: a hol
 iday\, a job\, a friend\, a place. Ask what made it so good.\n\nWHY IT WOR
 KS: Hearing the stories that shaped someone helps you understand what matt
 ers to them now.\n\nDay 33 of 60 · Week 5: Be curious\n\nTCH Works · Bet
 ter Partner Plan. Everyday relationship ideas\, not therapy or counselling
 . If things feel unsafe or overwhelming\, talk to your GP or a relationshi
 p counselling service. In an emergency call 999.
