SUMMARY:Nudge 34/60: What would he love more of?
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20261114T073000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20261114T074000
DTSTAMP:20261008T030000Z
UID:tch-better-partner-he-2026-10-12-34@tchworks.co.uk
DESCRIPTION:TODAY: Ask: 'What's something you'd love to have more of in yo
 ur life right now?' It might be sleep\, friends\, quiet\, adventure. Think
  about whether you can help make room for it.\n\nWHY IT WORKS: This one of
 ten surprises people. The answer is rarely what you'd guess.\n\nDay 34 of 
 60 · Week 5: Be curious\n\nTCH Works · Better Partner Plan. Everyday rel
 ationship ideas\, not therapy or counselling. If things feel unsafe or ove
 rwhelming\, talk to your GP or a relationship counselling service. In an e
 mergency call 999.
